Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.95,0:00:04.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這禮服還真華麗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.32,0:00:05.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.34,0:00:07.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,安靜一下　抓牢了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.34,0:00:14.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,特達戛上校　Archangel開始下潛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.91,0:00:18.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣會讓他們逃走　請下令攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.94,0:00:22.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓他們逃了？　這是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:24.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了 Archangel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.22,0:00:27.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉小姐和這世界的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.86,0:00:32.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布控制塔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.65,0:00:36.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是向貴國接近中的ZAFT軍MS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.16,0:00:41.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為與入港的ZAFT戰艦Minerva會合申請入境
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.18,0:00:43.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望能許可
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.48,0:00:46.50,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(170,300)}奧布軍基地
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.14,0:00:48.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.55,0:00:50.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種時候又來了ZAFT機？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.61,0:00:54.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想攻擊嗎　趕緊出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.47,0:01:02.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布控制塔　聽得見嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.33,0:01:03.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布控制塔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.84,0:01:07.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Murasame？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.69,0:01:13.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被鎖定了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.96,0:01:17.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布控制塔　到底怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.46,0:01:22.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我方沒有攻擊貴國的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.92,0:01:23.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為何開炮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.25,0:01:26.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布控制塔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.13,0:01:28.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼夢話
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.18,0:01:32.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布已經加盟世界安全保證條約機構
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.11,0:01:34.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PLANT是敵對國家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.66,0:01:39.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我國雖然還未與ZAFT軍進入交戰狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.12,0:01:41.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但也不可能允許入境
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.32,0:01:47.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,與大西洋聯邦達成同盟協議了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.72,0:01:51.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉沒能阻止他們嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.49,0:01:56.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,行政廳　我方識別編號2500474C
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.55,0:01:58.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯哈家的亞歷克斯 迪諾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.91,0:02:00.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請接通首相
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.12,0:02:01.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好快
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.08,0:02:04.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是行政廳
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.87,0:02:06.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無法回應你的要求
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.80,0:02:09.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事態緊急　拜託
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.18,0:02:11.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉　不可能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.51,0:02:13.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.58,0:02:17.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不知道你有什麼作戰計劃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.30,0:02:21.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然以逃之夭夭的Minerva為藉口　太愚蠢了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.32,0:02:24.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別小看奧布軍
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.01,0:02:27.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva不在了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.12,0:02:30.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.12,0:02:38.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上尉　這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.46,0:03:01.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉　可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,儚く散った光が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らを今呼び覚ます
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しみは音を立て
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,消えるあの場所から
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,深く愛する
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,勇氣と希望強く
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,感じるこの記憶が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絡み合う心と
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ココロをつないで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,動き出している
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,輝く光が照らし
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らを今呼び起こす
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,響きあう音を立て
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,刻むこの場所から
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,永久に信じ続けて…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PHASE-15　重返戰場
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.00,0:04:47.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎麼回事　居然幹這種傻事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.17,0:04:49.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們為什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.72,0:04:53.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,從結婚典禮上劫持國家元首
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.41,0:04:55.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是要被國際通緝的犯罪行為
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.65,0:04:56.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瘋了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.57,0:04:59.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰要求你們這樣做了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.24,0:05:01.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.96,0:05:06.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嘛　雖然明白這些
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.14,0:05:08.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.86,0:05:13.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在如果卡嘉莉也被捲入這種荒謬的事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.27,0:05:17.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全世界就真的沒救了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:19.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,荒謬的事？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.89,0:05:20.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.14,0:05:22.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係　拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.05,0:05:27.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哪裡荒謬了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.87,0:05:29.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是奧布的首相
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.19,0:05:34.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是經過深思熟慮才…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.85,0:05:40.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,才決定與大西洋聯邦同盟、和賽蘭結婚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.34,0:05:42.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,認為這樣能對奧布有好處
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.61,0:05:44.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉真的這樣想嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.54,0:05:47.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當然了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.02,0:05:50.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不然誰會結什麼婚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.82,0:05:53.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經沒有辦法了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.79,0:05:58.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉、烏納特和首長們說得沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.01,0:06:01.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不能讓奧布再次遭受浩劫
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.23,0:06:11.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為此現在只有這條路不是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.72,0:06:15.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但只要自保　其他國家就無所謂了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.19,0:06:23.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果以後奧布蹂躪PLANT或其他國家就無所謂嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.64,0:06:25.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這個…但是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.57,0:06:28.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還記得烏茲米大人說什麼嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.44,0:06:31.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.82,0:06:34.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,知道卡嘉莉很辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.44,0:06:38.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,至今為止什麼忙都沒幫上　抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:43.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但我認為現在還來得及
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.12,0:06:48.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也還有許多事不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.36,0:06:53.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我認為現在還來得及
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:10.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都一樣　選錯道路就走不到想去的地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.90,0:07:26.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以卡嘉莉也一起走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.19,0:07:29.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.62,0:07:43.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們這次一定得找到正確的答案
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.30,0:07:45.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.08,0:07:53.86,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(170,300)}ZAFT軍 卡潘塔利亞基地
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.08,0:08:00.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是Minerva的修理快完成了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.30,0:08:03.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯　是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.46,0:08:07.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那說不定什麼時候就會下達出航命令
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.93,0:08:10.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,得趁現在都買好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:12.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.45,0:08:16.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不知道要那麼多做什麼用
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.32,0:08:18.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,礙到你了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.40,0:08:22.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過,這次能回去了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.50,0:08:24.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看是回PLANT還是宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.72,0:08:25.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大概吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.43,0:08:28.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva原本就是宇宙用戰艦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.28,0:08:32.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不上月球軌道就沒意義了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.39,0:08:34.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PLANT不知怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.98,0:08:35.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.00,0:08:40.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被核彈打了　總有點擔心媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.11,0:08:42.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還有女友？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.47,0:08:44.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,才沒呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.30,0:08:47.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼總往那方面想
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.50,0:09:48.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這新型機是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.81,0:09:49.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.40,0:10:07.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭殿下！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.96,0:10:12.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,識別編號285002特種部隊FAITH所屬阿斯蘭 薩拉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.11,0:10:14.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請給予登艦許可
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.83,0:10:16.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個　剛才…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.01,0:10:18.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.92,0:10:21.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是怎樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.18,0:10:23.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.78,0:10:26.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能用這樣的語氣跟他說話
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.17,0:10:28.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他可是FAITH
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.67,0:10:34.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼你會是...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.78,0:10:35.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.42,0:10:52.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長在艦橋嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.69,0:10:54.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是的　應該是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.76,0:10:55.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我來帶…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.59,0:10:57.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,方便確認　我來帶路
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.89,0:11:00.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.05,0:11:05.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,回ZAFT了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.65,0:11:09.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,算是這樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.26,0:11:11.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.57,0:11:30.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說起來　為什麼突然歸隊了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.32,0:11:35.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,很想知道　可以嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.94,0:11:39.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,與其說是歸隊…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.43,0:11:43.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,去PLANT和議長見了一次面…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.59,0:11:47.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不說這些　Minerva什麼時候離開奧布的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.93,0:11:49.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我什麼都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.11,0:11:51.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你去奧布了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.85,0:11:52.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.69,0:11:54.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.11,0:11:55.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個國家現在已經…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.10,0:11:57.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,受到熱烈歡迎了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.33,0:12:01.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎有點明白真為什麼生氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.34,0:12:04.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個國家真是亂來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.84,0:12:08.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,知道離開奧布的時候　我們遭到什麼待遇了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.55,0:12:12.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被地球軍艦隊埋伏
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.41,0:12:14.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,險些沒命
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.73,0:12:18.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有真的話,Minerva肯定沉在那了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.05,0:12:21.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是卡嘉莉應該不會…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.29,0:12:24.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我之前雖然也比較尊敬她
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.24,0:12:26.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉 尤拉 阿斯哈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.28,0:12:28.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但實在太失望了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.67,0:12:32.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,先和大西洋聯邦簽訂同盟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.62,0:12:34.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還和古怪的傢伙結婚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.69,0:12:36.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,結婚？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.10,0:12:40.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯　前些日子新聞裡…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.19,0:12:47.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.72,0:12:52.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.49,0:12:57.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是不知是儀式時還是事後被劫持
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.63,0:12:59.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在行蹤不明
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.30,0:13:02.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只是聽說而已
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.29,0:13:05.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不太清楚　抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.56,0:13:22.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你回到FAITH，並為本艦配置了最新型機體
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.48,0:13:25.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且連我也成了FAITH？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.72,0:13:31.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長到底在想什麼　還有你也是...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.28,0:13:33.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.38,0:13:36.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼需要道歉的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.20,0:13:41.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這份命令內容　你知道嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.68,0:13:43.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不　並沒有被告知
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.43,0:13:47.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎？很有趣的內容
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:14:02.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva一旦可以出擊　就向直布羅陀前進
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.24,0:14:07.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,前往支援正進攻蘇伊士的當地駐軍
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.43,0:14:11.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,支援蘇伊士的駐軍？要我們？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.55,0:14:14.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為歐亞西部的紛爭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.07,0:14:17.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在是最麻煩的地區
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.56,0:14:22.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,蘇伊士的地球軍據點的確對直布羅陀是個問題
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.95,0:14:27.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但也不至於派我們從這裡趕去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.70,0:14:28.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.45,0:14:31.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva又不是地上戰艦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.09,0:14:33.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.83,0:14:36.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,歐亞西部的紛爭是指？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.73,0:14:38.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.01,0:14:41.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還未能全部了解
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.44,0:14:47.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經與大西洋聯邦統一…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.41,0:14:50.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,或者說被迫聽命的歐亞大陸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.27,0:14:53.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一部分地區吵著獨立鬧起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.60,0:14:55.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,最近才發生的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.03,0:14:57.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道也可以理解
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.78,0:15:01.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是開戰後不久
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.25,0:15:02.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:05.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,的確一直有些小小的摩擦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.91,0:15:08.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開戰後一下子鬧大了起來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.70,0:15:10.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,又是徵兵又是宣言的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.58,0:15:16.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,反抗地區的人民似乎再也不買帳了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.58,0:15:21.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地球軍對此用武力壓制
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.96,0:15:24.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎很慘
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.40,0:15:29.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,意思就是讓我們去那裡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.82,0:15:36.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的戰鬥追根究底是積極行使自衛權
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.05,0:15:39.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PLANT沒有侵略野心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.46,0:15:42.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,既然這麼說　可能不會輕易介入
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.03,0:15:45.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但勢必去那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.57,0:15:49.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且是派我們兩位FAITH
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.74,0:15:53.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,記好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.30,0:15:55.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.19,0:16:00.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.42,0:16:04.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布的事　艦長了解嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.88,0:16:09.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我什麼都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.82,0:16:12.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在鬧翻天了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.19,0:16:15.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為首相被劫持
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.84,0:16:19.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布政府雖然極力隱瞞
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.13,0:16:24.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,據說劫持首相的是Freedom和Archangel
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.87,0:16:41.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幹什麼？基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.44,0:16:49.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.07,0:16:52.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.40,0:16:54.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.01,0:16:56.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.47,0:17:12.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.68,0:17:16.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的艦長也成FAITH了？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.63,0:17:21.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯　副艦長說遲早會正式宣佈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.74,0:17:23.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看起來很高興的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.09,0:17:26.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和副艦長無關不是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.68,0:17:29.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎？副艦長不是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.96,0:17:32.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.34,0:17:37.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無關　FAITH是任命給個人的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.42,0:17:40.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼連這都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.40,0:17:46.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,個人戰績卓越　而且人格夠好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.94,0:17:49.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,得到評議會和議長承認的人才能當
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.03,0:17:54.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,權限比一般指揮官級別還高
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.66,0:17:57.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在前線甚至能夠策劃和發動作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.97,0:18:01.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,評議會直屬的ZAFT頂級精英
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.98,0:18:03.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼攀得上關係
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.10,0:18:05.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤蘭你自己還不是一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.66,0:18:06.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.99,0:18:08.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,頂級精英…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.43,0:18:11.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別無視人家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.70,0:18:17.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不　沒這個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.17,0:18:23.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在考慮些事情　有點心不在焉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.16,0:18:32.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼受打擊嗎？阿斯哈首相的結婚
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.93,0:18:35.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嘛　那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.08,0:18:39.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過誰叫是閃電式政治婚姻呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.54,0:18:41.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無可奈何吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.71,0:18:44.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的話絕對不願意
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.11,0:18:47.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什麼事？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.32,0:18:50.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！我叫露娜瑪莉雅
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.92,0:18:52.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜瑪莉雅 霍克
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.55,0:18:54.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Zaku Warrior的駕駛員
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.35,0:18:59.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這台機體是最新型的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.03,0:19:03.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說裝了變形機構
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.74,0:19:07.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,果然和Zaku完全不同
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.15,0:19:11.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和Impulse或者Chaos之類的差不多？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.44,0:19:13.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想試試嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.73,0:19:15.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可以嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.81,0:19:17.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯　請吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.75,0:19:18.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過別啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.31,0:19:20.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.62,0:19:25.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,選擇模式的控制板就不同啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.35,0:19:28.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,新的插件啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.37,0:19:30.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,啊　嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.77,0:19:32.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明晨嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.95,0:19:37.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯　卡潘塔利亞的司令部也來命令了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.98,0:19:40.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說會給我們配一艘博茲格羅夫級
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.21,0:19:42.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.27,0:19:44.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,「啊」什麼？阿瑟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.55,0:19:47.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,通知全艦　開始準備
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.15,0:19:49.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是…是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.66,0:19:54.61,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,300)}地球軍艦隊　旗艦 J.P JONES
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.05,0:20:02.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過我說那還是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.58,0:20:04.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒的事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.93,0:20:09.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這位小姐是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.69,0:20:11.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂　別去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.48,0:20:15.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在這幹什麼　我說
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.99,0:20:16.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,海
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.35,0:20:19.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在看海
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.20,0:20:22.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.68,0:20:29.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂　算了　她是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.11,0:20:31.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真是個怪傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.58,0:20:33.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我來一下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.42,0:20:42.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,放棄非份之想吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.08,0:20:46.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是第81獨立機動軍
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.48,0:20:51.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然呆呆的　她生起氣來可恐怖了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.74,0:20:55.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.90,0:21:03.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒看夠？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.33,0:21:08.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼歐在叫我們了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.76,0:21:14.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看來又要打仗了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.52,0:21:17.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過這也是我們的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.84,0:21:17.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.87,0:21:20.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次能打下幾台呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.55,0:21:21.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.94,0:21:31.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼古拉號出發
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.98,0:21:33.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.33,0:21:35.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva出擊　微速前進
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.84,0:21:39.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva出擊　微速前進
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.67,0:21:50.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和基拉一起的話應該不要緊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.40,0:21:54.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,反正也回不了奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.74,0:22:18.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,終於見面了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.65,0:22:21.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,找到你了　小貓咪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,涙で滲んだ  この時空を  見上げるたび
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,儚い蒼さが  胸を締めつけてく
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,運命なら  哀しみの果てまで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戦い続けた  日々を跡に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Life Goes On　燃え上がる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,命がある限り
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真実の自分さえ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,見失いそう　それでも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Life Goes On　守りたくて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,心は砕かれて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本当の哀しみを知った瞳は
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,愛に溢れて....
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.90,0:23:25.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,再次展開的戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.37,0:23:30.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是曾經　和即將見慣的光景
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.74,0:23:32.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了生存嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.66,0:23:34.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了成就嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.02,0:23:39.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,揮舞的劍下　真與阿斯蘭所見的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.39,0:23:44.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下回　機動戰士GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.92,0:23:46.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,印度洋的死鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.01,0:23:49.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,向著巨浪　前進！Abyss
